Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{user1Email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Sam",
  "lastName": "Waweru",
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}"
}

### 1.1.1  Test User token
POST  {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "{{token}}"
}

### 1.1.2 ✅ Successful Login - User 1
# @name loginUser1
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "{{user1Email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
