  "email": "weak@dukahub.test",
  "password": "{{weakPassword}}",
  "firstName": "Weak",
  "lastName": "Password",
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}"
}

### 1.5 ❌ Register with Missing Required Fields (Should Fail - 400)
