Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "paste-verification-token-from-email-here"
}

### 2.5 ❌ Verify with Invalid Token (Should Fail - 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "token": "invalid-token-12345"
}

