### 4. AUTHENTICATED USER PROFILE TESTS
### ============================================

### 4.1 ✅ Get Current User Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4.2 ❌ Get Profile Without Token (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me

### 4.3 ❌ Get Profile with Invalid Token (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_here

### 4.4 ❌ Get Profile with Expired Token (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.expired.token

### 4.5 ❌ Get Profile with Malformed Token (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer malformed-token

### ============================================
### 5. REFRESH TOKEN TESTS
### ============================================

### 5.1 ✅ Refresh Access Token
# NOTE: refreshToken is automatically sent via httpOnly cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### 5.2 ❌ Refresh Without Cookie (Should Fail - 401)
# Clear cookies first, then try refresh
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### 5.3 ❌ Refresh with Invalid Token (Should Fail - 401)
# Manually set invalid cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken=invalid_refresh_token

### 5.4 ❌ Refresh with Expired Token (Should Fail - 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
Cookie: refreshToken=expired_refresh_token

### 5.5 ✅ Multiple Refresh Requests (Token Rotation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

### ============================================
### 6. LOGOUT TESTS
### ============================================

### 6.1 ✅ Successful Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6.2 ❌ Logout Without Token (Should Fail - 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### 6.3 ❌ Logout with Invalid Token (Should Fail - 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token

### 6.4 ✅ Logout User 2
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken2}}

### 6.5 ❌ Access Protected Route After Logout (Should Fail - 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6.6 ❌ Refresh Token After Logout (Should Fail - 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh

