### ============================================
### 11. SECURITY EDGE CASES
### ============================================

### 11.1 ❌ SQL Injection Attempt in Email (Should Fail - 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "admin@dukahub.test' OR '1'='1",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 11.2 ❌ XSS Attempt in Name Fields (Should Be Sanitized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "xss@dukahub.test",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "<script>alert('XSS')</script>",
  "lastName": "User",
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}"
}

### 11.3 ❌ Very Long Password (Should Fail - 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "longpass@dukahub.test",
  "password": "VeryLongPasswordThatExceedsMaximumAllowedLengthForSecurityReasons123!@#$%^&*()VeryLongPasswordThatExceedsMaximumAllowedLengthForSecurityReasons123!@#$%^&*()",
  "firstName": "Long",
  "lastName": "Pass",
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}"
}

### 11.4 ❌ Unicode/Special Characters in Email
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "test@dükahub.test",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "firstName": "Unicode",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "merchantId": "{{merchantId}}"
}

### 11.5 ❌ Token Tampering (Modified JWT)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.tamperedpayload.tampered

