### ============================================
### NOTES FOR TESTING
### ============================================

# 1. Run tests in order (top to bottom)
# 2. Some tests depend on previous test results
# 3. Replace {{merchantId}} with actual UUID from database
# 4. For email verification, check your email or database for tokens
# 5. Refresh token tests require cookies to be enabled
# 6. Rate limiting tests may need delays between requests
# 7. Clean up test data after testing
